{"id":"4246111b42fbfb4a","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dim-sparse-change.md","title":"可计算零密度位置变化保持有效维数","display":"thm-dim-sparse-change — 可计算零密度位置变化保持有效维数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dim-sparse-change","aliases":["43-thm-dim-sparse-change"],"display":"thm-dim-sparse-change — 可计算零密度位置变化保持有效维数","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-effhausdim]]","[[43-df-effpackdim]]","[[43-df-ce]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_locator":"proof mechanism of Lem.17.5.1, printed p.523 / PDF p.543; local strengthening to both dimensions","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dim-sparse-change"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dim-sparse-change</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dim-sparse-change — 可计算零密度位置变化保持有效维数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28c411f76cbe3176\" href=\"?note=28c411f76cbe3176\" title=\"43-df-effpackdim\">43-df-effpackdim</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"proof mechanism of Lem.17.5.1, printed p.523 / PDF p.543; local strengthening to both dimensions"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ComputableSet}^{\\varnothing}\">\\(\\operatorname{ComputableSet}^{\\varnothing}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>，并假设</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ComputableSet}^{\\varnothing}(S)\\land\\lim_{n\\to\\infty,\\,n&gt;0}\\frac{|S\\cap\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}|}{n}=0\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus S\\;X(i)=Y(i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ComputableSet}^{\\varnothing}(S)\\land\\lim_{n\\to\\infty,\\,n&gt;0}\\frac{|S\\cap\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}|}{n}=0\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus S\\;X(i)=Y(i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有效维数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28c411f76cbe3176\" href=\"?note=28c411f76cbe3176\" title=\"43-df-effpackdim\">43-df-effpackdim</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\dim_H(X)=\\dim_H(Y)\\land\\mathrm{Dim}(X)=\\mathrm{Dim}(Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\dim_H(X)=\\dim_H(Y)\\land\\mathrm{Dim}(X)=\\mathrm{Dim}(Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从Y↾n、n以及X在S∩[0,n)上的位可恢复X↾n；位置由可计算S确定，故K(X↾n)≤K(Y↾n)+|S∩[0,n)|+O(log n)。交换X,Y得到复杂度差为o(n)，上下极限均保持。此为书中稀疏编码方法的明确一般化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effhausdim]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effpackdim","status":"resolved","id":"28c411f76cbe3176","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effpackdim]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$，$S\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{ComputableSet}^{\\varnothing}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]，并假设","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有效维数见 [[43-df-effhausdim]]、[[43-df-effpackdim]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effpackdim","status":"resolved","id":"28c411f76cbe3176","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有效维数见 [[43-df-effhausdim]]、[[43-df-effpackdim]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ComputableSet}^{\\varnothing}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ComputableSet}^{\\varnothing}(S)\\land\\lim_{n\\to\\infty,\\,n>0}\\frac{|S\\cap\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i<n\\}|}{n}=0\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus S\\;X(i)=Y(i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\dim_H(X)=\\dim_H(Y)\\land\\mathrm{Dim}(X)=\\mathrm{Dim}(Y).","display":true}],"bytes":1446,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-449","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-dim-sparse-change]] — 可计算零密度位置变化保持有效维数"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a","2114b7d641739c3e","28c411f76cbe3176","6c0559518cd32104"]}